# Hami Legal App — Architecture & Conventions

## ⛔ Golden Rule (لا تتجاوزه)

**لا تلاعب في الشكل أو التصميم إلا بإذن صريح.**  
Do NOT modify UI, colors, layout, fonts, or any visual aspect. Only backend logic, performance, and code quality.

---

## Project Context

Hyper-premium Legal Application and Closed E-commerce Marketplace for Iraqi lawyers.

**Design System:**
- Primary: Deep Navy `#0A0F1C` / `#05060D`
- Accents: Gold `#E6C673`, Emerald (success)
- Style: Glassmorphism, Motion.js, RTL, Tajawal/Cairo fonts

---

## Import Standards

- Use `@/` for `src/` and `@/app` for `src/app`
- Supabase config: `@/utils/supabase/info`
- Shared components: `@/app/components/figma/ImageWithFallback`, `@/app/components/shared/*`

---

## Routing (App.tsx)

State-based, no React Router. Screens: `splash` | `auth` | `client` | `lawyer` | `profile` | `admin` | `settings` | `privacy` | `support`

---

## Component Structure

- `SharedComponents`: PageWrapper, GlassCard, GoldButton, AppHeader
- `ui/`: shadcn-style primitives (Button, Card, Dialog, Input, etc.)
- `lawyer/`, `client/`, `admin/`: feature domains
- `figma/`: ImageWithFallback (asset fallback)

---

## Services (v2.0)

- `DataService`, `SupabaseService`, `AuthService`, `CryptoService`
- No AlternativePrivacyProtocol, WebAuthn, or figma:asset

---

## Animations

Import from `@/app/animations/transitions`. Use `screenTransitions.splash`, `.auth`, `.main`, `.secondary` for screens.

---

## Do NOT

- Use relative `../../../utils/supabase/info` — use `@/utils/supabase/info`
- Add AlternativePrivacyProtocol or figma:asset imports
- Break RTL or Arabic text layout
